name hep-font
category Package
revision 61164
shortdesc Latin modern extended by computer modern
longdesc The hep-font package loads standard font packages and extends
longdesc the usual Latin Modern implementations by replacing missing
longdesc fonts with Computer Modern counterparts. The package is loaded
longdesc with \usepackage{hep-font}.
